From: Lumi Camera <lumi@example.invalid>
Subject: [PATCH] aic_load_fw: bound T33gs USB RX pool to 128 16-KiB buffers

The vendor default reserves 1000 20-KiB RX buffers at module load. Keep
preallocation enabled for the USB receive path, but limit this board's pool
to 2 MiB of payload storage. Validate Wi-Fi throughput and pool exhaustion
on the board before shipping this module.

---
 aic_load_fw/aicwf_rx_prealloc.c | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/aic_load_fw/aicwf_rx_prealloc.c b/aic_load_fw/aicwf_rx_prealloc.c
--- a/aic_load_fw/aicwf_rx_prealloc.c
+++ b/aic_load_fw/aicwf_rx_prealloc.c
@@ -10,11 +10,11 @@
 
 struct aicwf_rx_buff_list aic_rx_buff_list;
 
-int aic_rxbuff_num_max = 1000;
+int aic_rxbuff_num_max = 128;
 #ifdef CONFIG_PLATFORM_HI
 int aic_rxbuff_size = (4 * 512) * 1;
 #else
-int aic_rxbuff_size = (4 * 512) * 10;
+int aic_rxbuff_size = 16 * 1024;
 #endif
 
 int rx_buff_list_ava = 0;
-- 
2.43.0
